    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念坐在吧台后面，面前摊着一个笔记本。\n她开始记录了。\n每次读心后失去的记忆，她都写下来："
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 2,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "Chen Rui",
      "Su Yuan",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian draws latte art in the foam",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "第1天：读心灰色西装男（顾深）。失去——手背上一道印痕。原因不明。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "faint mark",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "*第1天：读心灰色西装男（顾深）。失去——手背上一道印痕。原因不明。*\n*第2天：读心顾深。失去——右手手背小痣。*\n*第3天：读心顾深。失去——右手无名指戒指"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 3,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "scar on skin",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "但有一个共同点——每次失去的，都是身体上的痕迹。疤痕、痣、印记。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 4,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian furrows brow, pressing fingers to temples",
    "spoken_dialogue": "想不起来了",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "它们不是\"想不起来了\"——是物理性地消失了。连痕迹本身都不在了。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 5,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian furrows brow, pressing fingers to temples",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念合上笔记本，走到镜子前。\n她看着镜子里的自己。齐肩短发，圆脸，围裙。\n她记得自己的名字。记得咖啡店的名字。记得外婆的名字。\n但她不记得——\n父母的样子。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 6,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian turns hand over to inspect",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她翻出手机相册。有一个相册叫\"家人\"。她点开——"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 7,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Gu Shen",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian furrows brow, pressing fingers to temples",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "old photo",
    "emotion": "Mystery",
    "source_text": "第一张：一个年轻女人抱着婴儿。女人的脸模糊得像被水泡过。\n第二张：一个男人站在公园里，背景是一棵大榕树。男人的脸——完全空白。不是被遮挡，是不存在。照片上只有衣"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 8,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at the phone",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "规律：读心次数越多，失去的记忆越重要。从无关紧要的印记，到重要的人。",
    "voice_type": "inner_voice",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她关掉手机。\n笔记本上，她又加了一行：\n*规律：读心次数越多，失去的记忆越重要。从无关紧要的印记，到重要的人。*\n*如果继续下去——我会忘记谁？*\n*如果全部忘"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 9,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "the lights flicker and go out",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "窗外，天已经黑了。对面写字楼的灯一层层亮起来，又一层层灭掉。\n咖啡店里只剩下一盏吧台灯。灯光照在笔记本上，照在苏念握着笔的手上。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 10,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian stands still, shoulders slightly tense, eyes unfocused",
    "spoken_dialogue": "",
    "dialogue_speaker": "",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "none",
    "focus_object": "scar on skin",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "她的手背上，已经没有任何疤痕和印记了。\n光滑得像一张白纸。"
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 11,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Gu Shen"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Gu Shen",
    "action_visual": "the phone buzzes on the counter",
    "spoken_dialogue": "明天我来喝咖啡。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Gu Shen",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "手机响了。顾深的消息：\n\"明天我来喝咖啡。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 12,
    "space": "Physical",
    "characters_present": [
      "Su Nian",
      "Lin Ke",
      "grandmother"
    ],
    "primary_char": "Su Nian",
    "action_visual": "Su Nian gazes at",
    "spoken_dialogue": "别来了。",
    "dialogue_speaker": "Su Nian",
    "inner_voice": "",
    "voice_type": "onscreen",
    "focus_object": "",
    "emotion": "Neutral",
    "source_text": "苏念看着那行字，手指在屏幕上悬了很久。\n她打了一行字：\"别来了。\""
  },
  {
    "beat_id": 13,
    "space": "Physical",
